  "name": "Boxer Recruitment Form",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Boxer_Recruitment_Form",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-12T09:01:05.289Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Fight Club is Recruiting Boxers!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have YOU ever considered changing your ordinary life?"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To go from being the laughing stock of the town to a celebrity worshiped by all."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Or perhaps you're born with dazzling talent,"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "but you suffer from being a nobody,"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "then you are what the Fight Club has been waiting for."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You don't need combat skills honed through battle"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and you don't need outstanding physique"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "you just need the potential to be the center of attention"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and the courage to change yourself"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "then we will forge you into an unrivaled hero!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sign-up Requirements: You only need to be an adult!"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Boss Scott has the keenest eye and knows better than asking about a hero's past"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As long as you're an adult, we won't ask your gender, origin, or the reason you joined"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We accept sign-ups from all who meets the requirements!"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
